WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:04.860
The Marvel Cinematic Universe started simply
enough, making it easy for new audiences to

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:08.900
become fans of characters like Iron Man and
Captain America without having to read back

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.140
issues to feel caught up.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.179
With blockbuster success, however, comes great
expansion.

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:17.830
Roughly a decade after it launched, the MCU
now encompasses a huge array of movies and

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.020
tie-in TV shows.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.740
Fortunately, you don't need Doctor Strange's
Eye of Agamotto in order to see everything

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.900
Marvel has planned.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.620
Keep watching for every MCU movie and TV series
in development.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.240
Runaways

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.980
Marvel's Runaways made a big splash by breaking
the usual superhero formula.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.860
The book's main characters are all teenagers
who find out their parents are a secret group

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:38.560
of supervillains.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:43.080
Ultimately, they go on the run from both their
villainous parental units and the superheroes

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.980
who, unaware of what's really going on, think
they're all just troubled teens who need rescuing.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:51.210
Now, Runaways is being adapted into a show
for Hulu, where it'll face comparisons with

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.820
the critically-acclaimed corner of the MCU
that lives on Netflix.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:59.210
The comic it's based on has become a classic,
combining unique superpowers, dynamic characters,

00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:00.400
and tongue-in-cheek stories.

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.360
The cast looks pretty perfect, so here's hoping
Hulu does it justice.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:05.940
The Defenders

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:10.580
In many ways, The Defenders is the culmination
of Netflix's ambitious Marvel programming,

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.580
which set out to replicate on the small screen
what Marvel had already built in theaters.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:18.540
With its August 18 premiere, The Defenders
represents a unique opportunity to see how

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.760
Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage, and Iron
Fist will play off each other.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:25.120
Will Matt Murdock be cool with Jessica Jones
killing the villainous Killgrave?

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.520
Can Jones and ex-boyfriend Luke Cage work
together?

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.830
Will the legendary comic team-up of Cage and
Iron Fist be just as great on screen as it

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:32.840
is in the comics?

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:34.120
"I'm the Immortal Iron Fist."

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.520
"You what?!"

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:40.110
All in all, The Defenders is poised to make
as big a splash in its corner of the MCU as

00:01:40.110 --> 00:01:41.300
the Avengers did in theirs.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.700
Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:43.340
Season 5

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:48.400
Marvel's first attempt to extend its cinematic
universe to television, Agents of SHIELD brought

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.780
back Clark Gregg's charming and unassuming
Agent Coulson.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.860
But as the show's first season went on, it
quickly became apparent that Marvel's TV shows

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.800
would never really have an impact on their
movies.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.040
Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. has turned this to
its advantage, creating memorable characters

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.700
and adventures that aren't weighed down by
trying to connect to the big-screen MCU.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.460
The Avengers can keep Hawkeye; SHIELD got
Ghost Rider.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.860
Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. has kept its characters
and plot twists fresh over the course of its

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:14.180
first four seasons, and Marvel's TV chief
Jeph Loeb is very optimistic about the series'

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:15.980
return in the fall of 2017.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:20.180
From the depths of space to the heights of
virtual reality, SHIELD has gone pretty much

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:20.700
everywhere.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.560
The fifth season will also continue their
touchy relationship with the next group of

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.240
weirdos on our list...

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.260
The Inhumans

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:31.519
After Marvel pulled plans for an Inhumans
movie off their schedule, it looked like we'd

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:34.430
never see the adventures of Black Bolt and
the rest of his royal family.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:38.560
But instead of canceling the project outright,
the studio turned it into a TV show, slating

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.320
it for a September 26 debut.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.719
The Inhumans have already been a big part
of Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., and it looks like

00:02:43.719 --> 00:02:46.420
the new TV show has the potential to be huge.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.530
In addition to featuring the adventures of
a family from the moon and their enormous,

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:54.060
teleporting dog, the ability for the Inhumans
to activate dormant Inhuman powers in seemingly

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.260
normal people is the closest thing the MCU
has to mutants.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:01.659
Throw in the fact that Marvel is debuting
the first two episodes in a premium IMAX format,

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.600
and it's clear that this classic team has
major potential.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.120
The Punisher

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:09.720
Giving the Punisher his own show wasn't originally
part of Marvel's plan.

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:14.080
While they had long-term, Defenders-shaped
ideas for their main Netflix heroes, the breakout

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:18.890
popularity of Jon Bernthal's Frank Castle
necessitated giving him his own violent corner

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.660
of the MCU to fill with bullets.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.560
Marvel hasn't given us a lot to go on.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:26.720
Punisher's rumored release date is November
2017, but it hasn't been confirmed.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:30.260
Bernthal himself has hinted that the first
season might tell an origin story, taking

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.420
place before his introduction to Daredevil.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.459
We know Hannibal's former executive producer
Steven Lightfoot will be running things, which

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:39.160
guarantees that we'll get blood alongside
a solid story.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.220
Thor: Ragnarok

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.680
The trailers for Thor: Ragnarok pretty much
say it all: he'll lose his hammer, be cast

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.879
out of Asgard, and end up fighting the Hulk
on an alien planet.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:49.720
What more could you want?

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:51.700
"Yes!"

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.380
"We know each other.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:54.920
He's a friend from work!"

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:59.140
Thor's third solo big-screen adventure looks
like it'll have a little bit of everything,

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:02.060
from Asgardian mythology to Guardians of the
Galaxy style planet-hopping.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:06.840
Thor's growing friendship with Hulk also seems
to signify that this will be a funnier MCU

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.400
entry than the comparatively dreary doldrums
of The Dark World.

00:04:09.909 --> 00:04:13.540
In order to see who wins that epic fight between
Hulk and Thor — and find out whether the

00:04:13.549 --> 00:04:17.290
thunder god manages to travel from Hel and
back — you'll have to turn out for the premiere

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.060
on November 3.

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:19.900
Black Panther

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.120
Chadwick Boseman's Black Panther was a high
point in Captain America: Civil War, letting

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:28.780
viewers see the classic Marvel character as
both a fighter and as a reluctant king who

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.200
must take over after his father is killed.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.920
Thanks to Civil War, we already know Black
Panther's origins.

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.840
With that out of the way, the character's
solo movie can focus on the mysterious and

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:41.040
exotic kingdom of Wakanda, a thoroughly unexplored
corner of the MCU.

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.840
Details of the story have been pretty scarce,
but we're still marking our calendars for

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.180
Black Panther's arrival on February 16, 2018.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.400
Jessica Jones Season Two

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:53.940
In many ways, the first season of Jessica
Jones gave us our first real antihero in the

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:54.460
MCU.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:58.900
After surviving a traumatic crime-fighting
experience, Jones tries to lead a normal existence

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:00.140
as a private eye.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.280
That twist gave the series a unique appeal,
as we saw a full and fleshed-out narrative

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.820
arc with genuine emotional weight.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:10.240
In early 2018, we'll see what comes next for
Jessica Jones when her second season debuts

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:10.760
on Netflix.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.680
The previous season ended with Jessica and
her ally Malcolm committing themselves to

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:19.220
saving the world one client at a time via
Alias, her private investigation service.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:23.570
Her second season will air after The Defenders
debuts, and fighting alongside other heroes

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.500
may have changed how she sees the world and
her role in it.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.960
Get ready to stream your heart out when Jones
returns.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.880
Avengers: Infinity War

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:36.280
When it finally arrives on May 4, 2018, Avengers:
Infinity War promises to deliver the first

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:39.710
big payoff for everything the MCU has been
building toward since 2008.

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:43.720
The exact details of the story remain secret,
but we know it involves Thanos seeking the

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:46.700
Infinity Stones he needs to complete his powerful
Infinity Gauntlet.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:51.640
He promises to be a foe unlike any the Avengers
have faced before, so expect just about every

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:56.890
Marvel hero to show up in a live-action realization
of everyone's childhood action figure battles.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.060
You can probably expect a pretty huge cliffhanger
too — Marvel has already scheduled a release

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:04.300
date for the next giant Avengers movie, set
to premiere in 2019.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.940
Ant-Man and the Wasp

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:11.070
The first Ant-Man movie offered more than
a few surprises for comics fans and MCU junkies,

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:14.720
including the decision to focus on Marvel's
second Ant-Man, Scott Lang, rather than the

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.000
original one, Hank Pym.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.530
With the help of Pym and his daughter Hope,
Lang succeeds in saving the day as an unlikely

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:20.040
new hero.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.220
What, exactly, will the sequel entail?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:26.760
Hope van Dyne, played by Evangeline Lilly,
will take over her mother's old hero name,

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.900
which means we'll see the Wasp make her long-awaited
MCU debut.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:33.480
It seems likely that the movie will follow
up on the quest to find the original Wasp

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.150
in the Quantum Realm, especially since Michelle
Pfeiffer was announced for the role in the

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.200
summer of 2017.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:43.120
The movie's July 6, 2018 premiere date places
it in theaters just over two months after

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.130
Infinity War — and considering that the
entire face of the MCU could be different

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:51.060
by then, it may be up to Ant-Man and the Wasp
to pick up where other heroes have fallen

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:52.480
in their fight against Thanos.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.220
Daredevil Season Three

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:58.360
Daredevil kicked off Netflix's side of the
MCU by blowing everyone away with a tight

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:03.580
plot and perfect casting, including an unforgettable
turn from Vincent D'onofrio as the Kingpin.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:07.120
Daredevil's second season added fan favorite
characters Elektra and Punisher.

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.820
Where, then, will Daredevil be going in season
three?

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.840
Foggy has joined Jeri Hogarth's law firm.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:16.140
Elektra has given her life to save Daredevil,
only to be resurrected by the mysterious ninjas

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.000
of The Hand.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.920
Finally, Daredevil has revealed his secret
identity to girlfriend Karen Page, which should

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.220
change a lot of things.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.590
And Frank Castle is still on the loose, so
Daredevil's third season has plenty of chances

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.970
to show us a side of Daredevil that we've
never seen before…but we'll have to wait

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.700
until sometime in 2018 to see how everything
plays out.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.740
Luke Cage Season Two

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:39.340
After his introduction on Jessica Jones, Luke
Cage and his unbreakable body were a big hit

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.160
with audiences.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.340
The first season of his solo show proved that
Cage could carry an entire show on his broad

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:48.210
shoulders, but it left Cage in a pretty bad
place, which sets up a lot of plot points

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.780
that the second season may help unravel.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.460
Cage has been arrested, but has nothing to
prove his innocence.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:56.200
Even more concerning for our hero is that
his enemies Mariah and "Shades" are still

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.390
active, and the doctor that gave him his powers
is meeting with his brother-turned-enemy,

00:07:59.390 --> 00:07:59.900
Stryker.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.900
Luke Cage has a lot of cleaning up to do once
he gets out of jail, and we'll be waiting

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:06.480
for another awesome adventure sometime in
2018.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:08.600
New Warriors

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:13.460
One of Marvel's endless superhero teams, the
New Warriors were a surprise '90s hit.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.770
They've been reinvented from time to time,
but the core idea has usually revolved around

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:20.680
younger heroes banding together to take out
threats they couldn't handle alone, kind of

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:21.800
like a Junior Avengers.

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.500
But, y'know, not the actual Young Avengers.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.340
Comics are complicated.

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:29.340
Anyway, the New Warriors don't seem like the
likeliest fit for the modern MCU, but the

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.340
Freeform network thinks otherwise.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:35.240
They're bringing a live-action New Warriors
show to TV, complete with updated character

00:08:35.259 --> 00:08:38.990
stories and a new leader: breakout comics
star Squirrel Girl, who will be played by

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.960
AT&amp;T spokeswoman Milana Vayntrub.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:44.360
Her presence guarantees that this show won't
take itself too seriously.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:48.510
And if it means we get to see her in-depth
conversations with squirrels, then we're excited

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.300
for New Warriors 2018 debut.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.020
Cloak and Dagger

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:56.740
Another set of heroes that always seemed unlikely
to get a TV show, Cloak and Dagger have a

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:59.420
pretty weird origin in the pages of Marvel
Comics.

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:04.649
First appearing in the early 1980s, they were
given synthetic heroin by a criminal chemist,

00:09:04.649 --> 00:09:05.720
which gave them powers.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.640
So, that alone doesn't really make for a TV-friendly
origin story.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:13.060
And yet, here we are, with another unique
Marvel show coming to the Freeform network.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:17.000
Cloak is able to make himself intangible and
to teleport himself and others through the

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:18.460
sinister Darkforce dimension.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:22.700
Dagger, meanwhile, creates daggers of light
and can cure people of toxins.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.899
Neither character's powers are really suited
to the traditional fisticuffs of an MCU show,

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:31.380
but Marvel seems confident in Cloak &amp; Dagger,
which will premiere on Freeform in late 2018.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:32.960
Captain Marvel

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.440
With a long history in comics, Ms. Marvel
spent a long period of time on Marvel's back

00:09:37.440 --> 00:09:37.960
burner.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:41.340
In more recent years, she's been restored
to prominence, given a new image, and the

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.340
rank of Captain.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:46.520
Captain Marvel is now a cornerstone hit for
the company, making the character a natural

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.940
to provide the MCU with some much-needed female
representation.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:54.780
Brie Larson has signed on to star in Captain
Marvel, but beyond its March 8, 2019 release

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.900
date, it's anyone's guess what we can expect.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.300
The only thing we know we want to see on the
big screen?

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.940
MODOK, and his mega-crush on the superheroine.

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.720
Avengers 4

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:08.120
The fact that the fourth Avengers film is
coming out only one year after Infinity War

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.420
means their stories should be very closely
connected.

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:13.880
Considering that contracts are soon expiring
for veteran Avengers like Chris Evans and

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.700
Robert Downey, Jr., it seems likely we'll
see some of our favorite characters die or

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.360
be otherwise removed, forcing a new generation
of heroes to step up.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:25.209
Whether or not this comes to pass, it's a
sure bet that the Marvel Cinematic Universe

00:10:25.209 --> 00:10:27.980
will never be the same after May 3, 2019.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.180
Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:34.360
According to writer-director James Gunn, the
third installment in his popular Guardians

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.320
of the Galaxy series will be the end of the
Guardians as we know them.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.500
But the news surrounding Guardians of the
Galaxy Vol. 3 isn't all depressing.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:44.460
Regarding the upcoming film's soundtrack,
Gunn recently told fans on Twitter that he's

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.440
narrowed his musical choices down to 181 songs.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:51.680
We can also look forward to seeing the return
of Ayesha and the arrival of Adam Warlock,

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:54.400
one of the most anticipated characters in
MCU history.

00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:58.080
However, we'll still have to wait a little
while to watch the final adventures of Peter

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:58.720
Quill and company.

00:10:59.089 --> 00:11:04.200
On July 17, 2017, Gunn implied the film might
hit theaters in 2020.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:08.380
But the wait will be well worth it, as Gunn
promises Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3 will

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:09.400
be an epic conclusion.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.420
"I am Groot."

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:12.420
"No!"

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:13.720
Thanks for watching!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.680
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:18.200
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

